# Expo

Two apps. Do not merge them. Internal = staff. External = contractors + public.

- Keep Expo managed workflow. No eject.
- `EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_*` only. Never bundle the service role.
- Subscribe to Realtime for tender/bid status; do not poll.
- Gate screens by `profiles.role`. Still rely on RLS if someone tampers with the client.
- Public browse on the external app works signed out (`anon` + transparency views).
